   "quote": "Okay, do you have anything substantial to add to this? / ...Do you? / ...Data not found.",
   "line_start": 30,
   "line_end": 36
  },
  {
   "start": 153.4,
   "end": 173.1,
   "title": "Talking Out His Ass",
   "quote": "Did you just... talk out your ass? / Well... to be fair, Vegeta, you are part of my DNA.",
   "line_start": 40,
   "line_end": 44
  },
  {
   "start": 203.4,
   "end": 226.5,
   "title": "One Free Shot",
   "quote": "I'm about to pound you so hard, the boy's mother is going to be jealous. / Oh, can we not?!",
   "line_start": 51,
   "line_end": 57
  },
  {
   "start": 227.3,
   "end": 253.1,
   "title": "Bitch, I'm Adorable",
   "quote": "How did you get this strong?! / I trained *all* day yesterday. / Oh, you think you're being *cute*! / Bitch, I'm adorable.",
   "line_start": 58,
   "line_end": 68
  },
  {
   "start": 258.9,
   "end": 289.8,
   "title": "Rooting Against Cell",
   "quote": "Says the woman he left a single mother. / Please, I'm rich; it's hardly the same. / Would you really trust Vegeta with a baby? / Well, not *my* baby...",
   "line_start": 69,
   "line_end": 83
  },
  {
   "start": 318.4,
   "end": 335.4,
   "title": "Mission... *Start*",
   "quote": "'Okay, Krillin... Mission... (Gulp)... *Start*.'",
   "line_start": 90,
   "line_end": 95
  },
  {
   "start": 355.5,
   "end": 376.5,
   "title": "That's What Honesty Feels Like",
   "quote": "I drink people! / Were you trying to drink me? / N-n... no! / ...Yes. / That's what honesty feels like.",
   "line_start": 103,
   "line_end": 113
  },
  {
   "start": 392.1,
   "end": 417.4,
   "title": "YOU LOOK LIKE A FRUIT!",
   "quote": "I mean, look at that hair! / YOU LOOK LIKE A FRUIT! / ...EGGPLANT!",
   "line_start": 117,
   "line_end": 127
  },
  {
   "start": 434.9,
   "end": 459.42,
   "title": "...Go On",
   "quote": "If only you had showed up just a minute later... I would've had Eighteen... / ...Oh really? / ...Go on.",
   "line_start": 135,
   "line_end": 144
  },
  {
